     *
     * @param region the region code (e.g. {@code NSW})
     * @param fiscalYear the full fiscal year (its last two digits form FY)
     * @param hash8 the 8-character upper-hex HASH8
     * @return {@code <REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>}
